      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Every silo in a complex is a real Missile Silo with its hatches in place, missing exactly one part: a concrete block where the controller goes, or a glass block under it where the Energy Hatch goes.\n\nLook for the part in the Safe, Stockpile, Workshop and Control chests, or craft it. Put it in and the silo forms. A found Energy Hatch is EV, which launches up to Tier 2; swap in a LuV hatch for Tier 3. Power it and fire it from its own Launch Control, in the top row of the silo\u0027s window: the complex\u0027s silo is yours. Bring back the part you found.\n\n[warn]Clear the guard posts before you start working on the silo.[/warn]",
